{"seq":3,"slug":"ts-forecasting","title":"预测方法","docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"forecast-evaluation","title":"预测评估与模型选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/forecast-evaluation","wordCount":1461,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"ensemble-forecasting","title":"集成预测方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/ensemble-forecasting","wordCount":1238,"readingTime":5},{"seq":3,"slug":"forecast-evaluation","title":"预测评估与验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/forecast-evaluation","wordCount":1337,"readingTime":6},{"seq":4,"slug":"forecasting-framework","title":"预测框架体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/forecasting-framework","wordCount":1104,"readingTime":5},{"seq":5,"slug":"multistep-hierarchical","title":"多步预测与层级预测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/multistep-hierarchical","wordCount":1348,"readingTime":6},{"seq":6,"slug":"forecasting-systems","title":"预测系统工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/time-series-analysis/ts-forecasting/forecasting-systems","wordCount":1647,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 预测方法 简介\n\n本章聚焦时间序列预测的工程实践方法论。在实际业务中，预测不仅仅是建模，还包括预测流程的设计、多模型的集成以及预测结果的评估和持续优化。\n\n**预测框架与流程**介绍端到端的时间序列预测工作流程，包括问题定义、数据准备、模型训练、预测生成和结果监控等环节的最佳实践。\n\n**集成预测方法**讲解如何通过组合多个预测模型提升预测精度和鲁棒性，涵盖简单平均、加权集成和堆叠集成等方法的原理和实现。\n\n**预测评估与校准**探讨预测效果的评估指标体系和预测校准方法，包括点预测评估、区间预测评估和概率预测的校准技术。\n\n建议读者在掌握第2章的模型方法后学习本章，将模型能力与工程实践相结合。\n"}